# Paths that cargo-leptos copies into the site tree but that must not reach a deploy. Patterns are
# gitignore-style and resolve against the uploaded asset directory, which is the site root.
#
# repository/ holds the live bundle tree that `ingestion publish local` writes so `cargo leptos watch`
# can serve it same-origin at /repository during development. Production fetches the live bundle from
# repository.eafora.org instead, so uploading a developer's local publish output would ship stale
# artifacts to visitors and cost tens of megabytes per deploy.
/repository/

# Finder metadata. No client ever requests it.
.DS_Store
